  "description": "Byul-nim wakes up and finds out that he has changed his body with Daesu, who is himself in a parallel world. Byeol-nim thinks that unlike his original self, Kwon Dae-soo, a muscular man with a big chest and tall height, will not be able to lead a splendid life, and he wanders in search of a way to return to his original world. Will Byul-nim be able to take off Daesoo's mask and restore his original body?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/star_nim/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/daesoo_byulnim)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/star_nim), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/star_nim)",
